  "rationale": "The batch exposes weak support for several recurring continuations: a noun after an initial determiner (including the representative The → needles error), This → is, and And → that/so followed by that → was in two endings. The relevant output roots have only tiny generic mass for these continuations, so add narrow, causal suffix rules rather than infer a story phase or introduce a head. And may validly lead to more than one continuation, so both that and so receive support. The determiner-to-needles rule is lexical and may not transfer to other nouns; the replay gate must check whether these additions help the batch without harming earlier examples.",
